WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.846
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.116 --> 00:13.368
[♪ opening theme music playing]

3
00:13.452 --> 00:14.911
[bird screeching]

4
00:37.392 --> 00:40.771
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

5
00:42.731 --> 00:45.400
[footsteps approaching]

6
00:48.236 --> 00:50.238
[♪ gentle music playing]

7
01:19.601 --> 01:21.228
I heard that you were injured.

8
01:23.105 --> 01:24.648
I trust you've been treated?

9
01:24.731 --> 01:26.692
I was supposed to see the physician,

10
01:27.526 --> 01:29.611
but he was summoned by you, Your Majesty.

11
01:31.446 --> 01:32.572
Ah.

12
01:33.615 --> 01:35.117
It was for my shoulder.

13
01:35.951 --> 01:37.077
He examined it.

14
01:46.503 --> 01:47.921
[cutlery clinking]

15
01:48.004 --> 01:49.256
[clinking stops]

16
01:52.050 --> 01:53.260
Isn't it strange?

17
01:54.845 --> 01:56.471
This table feels longer today.

18
01:57.097 --> 01:58.265
[scoffs]

19
01:58.765 --> 01:59.766
Very strange.

20
02:01.560 --> 02:03.937
How is questioning the assassin progressing?

21
02:06.481 --> 02:07.816
It's very serious,

22
02:08.733 --> 02:09.943
but you've been reticent.

23
02:11.194 --> 02:12.612
It's still ongoing.

24
02:16.032 --> 02:17.576
And the runaway slave?

25
02:20.454 --> 02:22.664
-[breathes deeply] -[♪ tense music playing]

26
02:26.209 --> 02:27.711
How did you hear of that?

27
02:30.255 --> 02:31.465
Walls have ears…

28
02:31.965 --> 02:34.134
more so with all the walls in this palace.

29
02:34.217 --> 02:35.302
[scoffs]

30
02:36.720 --> 02:39.222
[Sovieshu] I don't know what you've heard about it,

31
02:39.306 --> 02:41.266
but I was just aiding her,

32
02:41.349 --> 02:43.185
because she was gravely hurt.

33
02:43.769 --> 02:45.645
That's as I suspected.

34
02:46.146 --> 02:48.523
Because you have always been a compassionate ruler.

35
02:48.607 --> 02:51.902
She might have had her ankle broken by that trap without us.

36
02:51.985 --> 02:53.445
Poor little thing.

37
02:58.074 --> 03:01.661
Since you sent the Imperial Physician, she'll be well soon.

38
03:08.627 --> 03:10.045
[cutlery clinks softly]

39
03:29.940 --> 03:31.441
Send that girl to my palace.

40
03:33.318 --> 03:36.029
I will care for her until her wounds are better,

41
03:36.112 --> 03:37.155
then she'll be sent back.

42
03:37.239 --> 03:38.365
[Sovieshu] Enough about that.

43
03:38.448 --> 03:41.076
It's our time to dine together on our own.

44
03:41.159 --> 03:42.285
Let's talk of other things.

45
03:42.369 --> 03:44.704
Women can enter the royal palaces…

46
03:45.497 --> 03:47.249
if I grant consent.

47
03:47.332 --> 03:49.543
As you know, this law stands for all women.

48
03:50.794 --> 03:52.045
A serving girl,

49
03:52.128 --> 03:53.171
a courtier…

50
03:55.131 --> 03:56.216
a mistress.

51
04:06.560 --> 04:07.894
A serving girl…

52
04:09.604 --> 04:10.814
a courtier…

53
04:15.652 --> 04:17.112
[exhales deeply]

54
04:18.780 --> 04:19.990
a mistress.

55
04:28.915 --> 04:29.958
Yes.

56
04:30.458 --> 04:32.002
We cannot break our traditions.

57
04:36.172 --> 04:37.424
[sighs]

58
04:48.184 --> 04:50.186
If a mistress needs your consent…

59
04:53.481 --> 04:54.733
then listen…

60
04:57.444 --> 04:59.571
that is what I ask you for.

61
05:17.923 --> 05:18.924
I forbid it.

62
05:19.007 --> 05:20.050
[♪ music intensifies]

63
05:21.509 --> 05:22.510
[sighs]

64
05:22.594 --> 05:23.637
Everybody, leave us.

65
05:31.394 --> 05:32.520
[door closes]

66
05:37.525 --> 05:40.278
That hunting trophy Your Majesty brought back

67
05:40.904 --> 05:42.072
is a slave.

68
05:43.782 --> 05:45.325
She's not a trophy, she is a person.

69
05:45.408 --> 05:47.285
She's not a slave, she's Rashta.

70
05:47.369 --> 05:49.204
She has a name, you know.

71
05:49.287 --> 05:50.914
You say that Rashta's her name.

72
05:51.748 --> 05:53.041
No surname, I take it?

73
05:53.124 --> 05:55.043
Do you even know what house she's from?

74
05:56.544 --> 05:59.965
If you take in a girl like that, there'll be no end to the gossiping.

75
06:02.717 --> 06:04.469
Do not go any further.

76
06:04.552 --> 06:05.804
You must expel her now.

77
06:05.887 --> 06:08.014
It really doesn't matter what her surname is.

78
06:08.098 --> 06:09.182
[♪ music fades]

79
06:14.187 --> 06:16.314
Thanks to meeting that poor young girl,

80
06:18.692 --> 06:20.777
I felt my heart flutter at last.

81
06:27.409 --> 06:28.952
[♪ heartfelt sad music playing]

82
06:29.035 --> 06:30.078
"At last"?

83
06:32.497 --> 06:34.374
How could you tell me such a thing?

84
06:34.457 --> 06:38.086
I never thought a feeling like this could take hold of me either.

85
06:49.931 --> 06:51.850
We should not be bickering about this.

86
06:51.933 --> 06:53.643
It will only make things worse for us.

87
06:58.273 --> 07:00.942
There will be nothing that changes between you and me.

88
07:04.446 --> 07:06.072
No matter what happens,

89
07:08.408 --> 07:10.160
you are my only wife.

90
07:18.918 --> 07:21.087
That image of "you and me" will be a facade.

91
07:24.174 --> 07:27.135
Our laws must be upheld and respected by all.

92
07:28.344 --> 07:31.222
The presence of slaves is strictly forbidden in the palace.

93
07:32.724 --> 07:34.642
If you want to make a mistress of her,

94
07:35.727 --> 07:37.520
then emancipation must be sought.

95
07:39.314 --> 07:40.732
Without evidence, I will not approve it.

96
07:44.611 --> 07:46.404
If you won't grant approval…

97
07:54.871 --> 07:56.581
then I'll just create a new law.

98
07:57.832 --> 07:59.834
[♪ dramatic music playing]

99
08:24.275 --> 08:26.528
[Marquess Lante] Your Majesty, perhaps you should reconsider

100
08:26.611 --> 08:27.821
the matter of Ms. Rashta.

101
08:27.904 --> 08:29.739
Being a slave means that she or one of her ancestors

102
08:29.823 --> 08:32.617
committed a crime grave enough to warrant a life sentence.

103
08:32.700 --> 08:34.244
And what's more, since she's a runaway,

104
08:34.327 --> 08:37.956
she couldn't possibly be eligible to be reviewed and granted emancipation.

105
08:38.039 --> 08:40.166
If that is the case, I'll change that law as well.

106
08:42.210 --> 08:44.504
We don't know if she was kidnapped by slave traders,

107
08:44.587 --> 08:47.715
or she may well even be the daughter of an aristocrat,

108
08:47.799 --> 08:49.592
or a child who lost her way.

109
08:49.676 --> 08:51.636
Why would you be so blind

110
08:51.719 --> 08:54.597
as to think she was enslaved for committing a crime?

111
08:55.181 --> 08:57.058
You saw her face, Marquess Lante.

112
08:57.559 --> 08:58.977
[chuckles softly]

113
08:59.060 --> 09:00.436
I ask you,

114
09:00.520 --> 09:02.397
could a slave have such beauty?

115
09:04.065 --> 09:05.817
-[chuckles softly] -[♪ moody music playing]

116
09:12.115 --> 09:13.491
[door opens]

117
09:13.575 --> 09:15.243
[wind blows]

118
09:15.326 --> 09:17.245
[♪ music continues]

119
09:20.832 --> 09:22.041
[exhales sharply]

120
09:43.605 --> 09:45.732
Thanks to meeting that poor young girl,

121
09:47.942 --> 09:50.111
I felt my heart flutter at last.

122
09:53.823 --> 09:54.908
[Eliza] Your Majesty,

123
09:55.909 --> 09:57.493
you'll catch a cold like that.

124
09:59.370 --> 10:00.580
Leave it.

125
10:02.457 --> 10:04.250
I don't feel cold. I'm fine.

126
10:06.794 --> 10:08.254
[sighs heavily]

127
10:09.464 --> 10:11.466
[♪ gentle music playing]

128
10:29.651 --> 10:31.027
[knock on door]

129
10:34.489 --> 10:35.949
Your Majesty, I'm here!

130
10:42.538 --> 10:44.290
His Majesty commands your presence.

131
10:52.131 --> 10:53.299
[gasps]

132
10:55.885 --> 10:56.886
[Rashta gasps]

133
11:15.947 --> 11:17.073
[gasps softly]

134
11:19.367 --> 11:20.618
[breath trembling]

135
11:24.038 --> 11:25.498
Did your master do this?

136
11:38.761 --> 11:40.138
You said you'd ensure

137
11:41.222 --> 11:44.058
I was never put through suffering again, Your Majesty.

138
11:45.393 --> 11:46.769
Did you mean it?

139
12:01.868 --> 12:03.786
-[slave exclaims] -[Lotteshu] You slave brat. How dare you?

140
12:03.870 --> 12:05.663
Damn it! [grunts]

141
12:05.747 --> 12:07.665
-I'm a shit, am I? Huh? -[slaves sobbing]

142
12:07.749 --> 12:09.334
Take that! Son of a bitch!

143
12:09.417 --> 12:11.169
-[henchman] Wait a minute. -What's that?

144
12:11.836 --> 12:14.005
-What? -Master, I think he's dead.

145
12:14.088 --> 12:16.632
Ah, you… you should've told me sooner.

146
12:16.716 --> 12:18.843
I've been beating a sodding dead man.

147
12:18.926 --> 12:20.136
[sighs]

148
12:20.219 --> 12:21.262
Ugh…

149
12:22.263 --> 12:24.474
-Let's do the rest tomorrow. -[henchman] Yes, sir.

150
12:24.557 --> 12:27.226
Take this arsehole and string him up in the square.

151
12:27.310 --> 12:29.103
He'll be a lesson for the runaway bastards.

152
12:29.187 --> 12:30.688
-[slaves sobbing] -God's sake!

153
12:30.772 --> 12:32.398
Be quiet, or I'll give you something to cry about!

154
12:34.192 --> 12:36.319
And why haven't the men caught that bloody girl?

155
12:36.402 --> 12:37.487
They should have come back.

156
12:37.570 --> 12:38.821
I'm sure they'll get her back, sir.

157
12:38.905 --> 12:40.990
-So you say. -[henchman] Quiet!

158
12:41.616 --> 12:43.659
I think the bounty hunters are coming!

159
12:43.743 --> 12:44.911
Oh, good!

160
12:48.998 --> 12:50.458
Ah, they're here at last!

161
12:53.044 --> 12:54.879
Oh, it's the Emperor's men.

162
12:56.422 --> 12:57.590
What's this?

163
12:58.591 --> 12:59.801
Whose men?

164
13:06.224 --> 13:07.600
[horse neighs]

165
13:11.270 --> 13:12.814
Are you Viscount Lotteshu?

166
13:15.858 --> 13:16.859
Yes, I am.

167
13:16.943 --> 13:18.194
[groans in pain]

168
13:18.277 --> 13:21.030
[grunts] Sir! I'm sure this is a misunder--

169
13:23.616 --> 13:25.868
The men you sent entered the palace hunting grounds

170
13:25.952 --> 13:28.037
and attempted to assassinate the Emperor.

171
13:28.871 --> 13:31.207
It can't be. My men weren't there. [whimpers]

172
13:32.417 --> 13:34.252
They confessed that they were paid by you!

173
13:34.335 --> 13:36.087
This must be a hideous mistake.

174
13:36.170 --> 13:38.297
I just sent the men after a runaway slave

175
13:38.381 --> 13:39.924
to capture her and to bring the woman back.

176
13:40.007 --> 13:42.135
-You bastard! -[Marquess Lante] Stop there.

177
13:42.218 --> 13:43.761
[Lotteshu sobs]

178
13:52.562 --> 13:54.564
[breath trembling]

179
14:03.156 --> 14:04.740
[cell door shuts]

180
14:05.324 --> 14:06.701
You know who's addressing you?

181
14:06.784 --> 14:08.286
[voice trembling] Your… Majesty.

182
14:08.369 --> 14:11.497
Please! It must be just a… all a kind of awful mix-up.

183
14:11.581 --> 14:13.374
I know of your kind.

184
14:13.457 --> 14:16.169
Your father, his father, and his father as well.

185
14:16.961 --> 14:19.380
Your lot has bought and sold people for generations.

186
14:19.463 --> 14:22.675
And while my army and I shed our blood in the war,

187
14:22.758 --> 14:25.178
you vile creatures grew fat,

188
14:25.261 --> 14:27.305
chasing after the scraps of death.

189
14:27.388 --> 14:29.432
Did you not take children

190
14:29.515 --> 14:31.934
and then trade them as slaves with outlawed pirates?

191
14:32.018 --> 14:34.061
Ah! Oh no, my lord, not ever, my lord!

192
14:34.145 --> 14:35.938
I… I just wanted to catch the girl.

193
14:36.022 --> 14:37.690
I'd already signed a contract.

194
14:37.773 --> 14:39.442
It was with a tavern in the port city,

195
14:39.525 --> 14:42.320
but because that ungrateful bitch ran away, I lost…

196
14:43.654 --> 14:45.031
Open your eyes.

197
14:45.114 --> 14:46.699
[sobbing]

198
14:51.329 --> 14:52.663
Do you know what this is?

199
14:53.539 --> 14:54.707
A slave contract, my lord.

200
14:54.790 --> 14:56.584
No, it isn't that at all.

201
14:57.293 --> 14:58.753
It is evidence in fact.

202
14:58.836 --> 15:00.880
Every one of your crimes is written on it.

203
15:00.963 --> 15:03.841
I could punish you for any one of these offenses, could I not?

204
15:03.925 --> 15:07.178
Yes. Every crime I've committed is on that page.

205
15:10.598 --> 15:12.516
What should we do with him?

206
15:13.226 --> 15:14.685
I think you should decide.

207
15:20.608 --> 15:22.610
[♪ foreboding music playing]

208
15:29.075 --> 15:30.076
[gasps]

209
15:36.165 --> 15:37.416
Do not be afraid.

210
15:38.793 --> 15:40.127
I'm right here with you.

211
15:43.839 --> 15:46.676
Now I think this bastard should be punished.

212
15:46.759 --> 15:48.302
I could make him into a slave,

213
15:49.512 --> 15:53.391
or I could have his arms and legs torn off his body one by one.

214
15:55.309 --> 15:56.852
[Rashta screaming]

215
16:00.273 --> 16:02.191
-[whip lashing] -[Rashta screaming]

216
16:04.360 --> 16:06.821
[sobbing, panting weakly]

217
16:15.621 --> 16:17.164
I gladly accept any punishment.

218
16:17.248 --> 16:19.375
Even if you tear off my arms and legs,

219
16:19.458 --> 16:21.794
it won't erase my crimes, Your Majesty.

220
16:21.877 --> 16:23.087
[stammers] But… But…

221
16:23.170 --> 16:24.588
if I have one wish…

222
16:24.672 --> 16:26.007
my Rashta…

223
16:26.090 --> 16:28.301
No, no, not mine. I mean, Lady Rashta!

224
16:28.384 --> 16:30.803
I want to ask for her forgiveness.

225
16:36.976 --> 16:38.185
Rashta.

226
16:38.686 --> 16:40.771
Never let that name pass your lips ever again.

227
16:40.855 --> 16:44.358
Disobey me, and I will have your entire family erased.

228
16:44.442 --> 16:46.027
Yes, I understand.

229
16:46.110 --> 16:47.987
It will never pass my lips again.

230
16:49.363 --> 16:51.490
Mark him in some way to remind him of this always.

231
16:56.329 --> 16:58.080
[whimpering]

232
17:01.792 --> 17:06.756
-[squelches] -[Lotteshu screaming]

233
17:11.761 --> 17:13.304
[breathing shakily]

234
17:22.938 --> 17:24.565
[gasps softly]

235
17:25.441 --> 17:27.526
[♪ enchanting music playing]

236
17:36.869 --> 17:37.870
[gasps]

237
17:39.997 --> 17:41.207
I trust you slept well?

238
17:44.543 --> 17:45.795
Where is this?

239
17:46.504 --> 17:47.755
What is this?

240
17:47.838 --> 17:50.007
This chamber is the Rose Room,

241
17:50.841 --> 17:52.426
which will now be yours.

242
17:52.510 --> 17:53.636
[gasps]

243
18:08.567 --> 18:10.611
[♪ enchanting music continues]

244
18:15.825 --> 18:17.076
It's lovely.

245
18:18.035 --> 18:20.287
Do you really mean this room is all for me?

246
18:23.165 --> 18:25.209
[Marquess Lante] If you need anything, or if you're not comfortable,

247
18:26.127 --> 18:27.670
just tell these maids-in-waiting.

248
18:27.753 --> 18:30.005
[both] It's our honor to serve you, my lady.

249
18:32.967 --> 18:34.427
Go and tell His Majesty she's awake.

250
18:35.010 --> 18:36.262
Yes, sir.

251
18:37.430 --> 18:38.973
[Kisia giggles]

252
18:39.640 --> 18:40.641
[mouths] Now?

253
18:42.268 --> 18:43.728
Oh. Now!

254
19:11.172 --> 19:13.340
I really love it, Your Majesty.

255
19:16.427 --> 19:17.678
You're better now you've rested?

256
19:19.972 --> 19:20.973
You can leave us.

257
19:25.019 --> 19:26.562
I brought you a gift.

258
19:26.645 --> 19:29.440
You've been so… so generous.

259
19:30.775 --> 19:34.278
It's a dream already just being by your side, Your Majesty.

260
19:34.987 --> 19:35.988
It's true.

261
19:40.451 --> 19:41.744
Thank you.

262
19:41.827 --> 19:43.204
What is this?

263
19:45.289 --> 19:46.791
A slave certificate.

264
19:47.625 --> 19:48.667
The one signed for you.

265
19:51.504 --> 19:54.173
SLAVE CERTIFICATE PURCHASER: VISCOUNT LOTTESHU RIMWELL

266
19:54.256 --> 19:55.299
SLAVE NAME RASHTA

267
19:56.884 --> 19:58.385
Your… Majesty.

268
19:58.469 --> 19:59.970
You are no longer

269
20:00.679 --> 20:02.306
a slave to anyone.

270
20:09.980 --> 20:11.732
Let this erase the past.

271
20:12.483 --> 20:13.776
It's all gone now.

272
20:22.952 --> 20:24.537
[sobbing]

273
20:39.927 --> 20:41.804
Lady Laura! Viscountess Verdi!

274
20:42.555 --> 20:44.348
-[Annie] Did you hear? -[Verdi and Laura] What?

275
20:44.431 --> 20:46.809
[Annie] Apparently, His Majesty entered the Rose Room

276
20:46.892 --> 20:48.310
but he has not come out since Monday.

277
20:48.394 --> 20:49.562
[gasps]

278
20:49.645 --> 20:51.856
-Once any man's mind is lost to a lover… -Huh?

279
20:51.939 --> 20:53.107
…he's beyond help then.

280
20:53.190 --> 20:54.483
Laura!

281
20:55.150 --> 20:57.027
I didn't say who I meant, did I?

282
20:57.111 --> 20:58.737
Mmm. Just observing.

283
20:58.821 --> 21:00.072
Well, there's that story

284
21:00.155 --> 21:01.699
that the Rose Room has been cursed, isn't there?

285
21:01.782 --> 21:03.409
-Did you know? -It's cursed?

286
21:03.492 --> 21:06.412
They say it was cursed by the old Late Dowager Empress.

287
21:06.495 --> 21:08.539
Knowing what a womanizer the late emperor was,

288
21:08.622 --> 21:10.833
the rumors were always certain to go around the whole court.

289
21:10.916 --> 21:13.043
Yes, but, out of all those girls,

290
21:13.127 --> 21:15.838
I'm sure the Rose Room's never had to house a runaway slave.

291
21:15.921 --> 21:17.131
-Ah! -You behave!

292
21:17.214 --> 21:18.966
Lady Laura, you be careful.

293
21:19.049 --> 21:20.342
Do you want trouble?

294
21:20.426 --> 21:23.596
His Majesty has proclaimed we'll be punished for saying those words.

295
21:23.679 --> 21:25.973
We mustn't be caught saying "runaway slave."

296
21:26.056 --> 21:28.058
You… babies.

297
21:28.142 --> 21:30.311
Runaway slave! Runaway slave!

298
21:30.394 --> 21:31.478
[scoffs]

299
21:31.562 --> 21:32.688
Honestly…

300
21:33.188 --> 21:34.648
what am I supposed to call a runaway slave,

301
21:34.732 --> 21:36.400
if not a runaway slave?

302
21:36.483 --> 21:37.651
[gasps]

303
21:42.573 --> 21:44.617
She's not a slave, she's a commoner.

304
21:46.827 --> 21:49.914
From what I hear, His Majesty summoned the girl's master

305
21:49.997 --> 21:51.540
and had him beaten to a bloody pulp.

306
21:51.624 --> 21:52.625
Shh!

307
21:55.336 --> 21:58.339
The rumors that she was a runaway slave are not just idle talk.

308
21:59.048 --> 22:00.841
Rashta's not bound as a slave.

309
22:02.092 --> 22:06.055
His Majesty has said she's not, and it must therefore be true.

310
22:09.725 --> 22:10.809
-Yes. -Yes.

311
22:10.893 --> 22:13.354
This is the list of guests Your Majesty will be receiving.

312
22:13.437 --> 22:16.398
Please pay special attention to my guests from the Southern Kingdom.

313
22:16.482 --> 22:17.691
Yes.

314
22:22.196 --> 22:23.656
That's the Western Kingdom.

315
22:23.739 --> 22:25.282
Why is the Emperor not welcoming their king?

316
22:25.366 --> 22:27.117
We have made adjustments,

317
22:27.201 --> 22:29.078
as Prince Heinrey, the king's younger brother,

318
22:29.161 --> 22:30.329
will be attending in his stead.

319
22:30.412 --> 22:31.747
But no need to feel burdened by that.

320
22:31.830 --> 22:35.334
Rumor has it he is far from capable of discussing affairs of state.

321
22:35.417 --> 22:36.919
Yes, I've heard reports.

322
22:37.002 --> 22:39.129
He's been famous for quite a lot of exploits, sir.

323
22:39.213 --> 22:41.715
Yet, the power and wealth the Western Kingdom holds

324
22:41.799 --> 22:43.801
is in no way inferior to our own.

325
22:43.884 --> 22:45.469
We must not forget its importance.

326
22:45.552 --> 22:47.429
Yes, Your Majesty.

327
22:51.600 --> 22:53.602
-[door closes] -So will we finally see

328
22:53.686 --> 22:55.104
this prince we've heard about?

329
22:55.187 --> 22:56.730
The rumors can't all be true.

330
22:57.314 --> 23:00.567
His dreamy eyes can draw you in just like magic.

331
23:00.651 --> 23:03.988
[Laura] I heard he's a real ladies' man, and a total narcissist,

332
23:04.071 --> 23:06.490
and they say that he hangs around with some pirates as well.

333
23:06.573 --> 23:09.994
The stories I know about Prince Heinrey are rather different.

334
23:10.619 --> 23:12.204
Would you tell us what you know of him, please.

335
23:12.287 --> 23:14.540
[Artina] Of course. Thanks to Sir Kosair,

336
23:14.623 --> 23:17.126
in the West, there were just a few Springwater Bandits

337
23:17.209 --> 23:18.877
and they entered the Western Kingdom's lands.

338
23:19.670 --> 23:20.754
[barmaid screams]

339
23:20.838 --> 23:22.965
[Artina] They raided a border village in the Western Kingdom.

340
23:23.048 --> 23:24.508
-Get over here. -[bandits laugh]

341
23:24.591 --> 23:25.926
[barmaid 1 whimpering]

342
23:27.594 --> 23:29.138
[barmaid 2 screaming]

343
23:30.222 --> 23:31.390
[bandit 1] Trample them!

344
23:32.850 --> 23:34.059
Ah! [whimpers]

345
23:36.353 --> 23:37.688
[Artina] But then,

346
23:37.771 --> 23:39.565
Prince Heinrey and a single attendant,

347
23:39.648 --> 23:41.567
who were just about to cross the border,

348
23:41.650 --> 23:43.068
happened to encounter them.

349
23:45.863 --> 23:48.323
[♪ heroic music playing]

350
23:51.118 --> 23:52.411
[bandit 2] Who are you?

351
23:53.495 --> 23:54.538
[Heinrey] Me?

352
23:56.582 --> 23:58.876
I'm Heinrey of the Western Kingdom.

353
23:58.959 --> 24:00.252
[♪ music intensifies]

354
24:03.130 --> 24:04.423
[bandits yelling]

355
24:08.010 --> 24:09.595
-[bandit grunts] -[Heinrey grunts]

356
24:12.806 --> 24:13.891
[yelling]

357
24:15.768 --> 24:17.561
-[groaning] -[grunting]

358
24:24.401 --> 24:25.486
[grunting]

359
24:43.545 --> 24:44.630
[bandit yells]

360
24:52.221 --> 24:53.764
[bandit grunts]

361
25:02.397 --> 25:04.483
[bandit grunting]

362
25:04.566 --> 25:07.027
[bandit whimpering]

363
25:10.948 --> 25:11.990
[Heinrey] Well then…

364
25:12.074 --> 25:13.867
What would you like to drink, sir? It's on me.

365
25:14.743 --> 25:16.703
Oh, no alcohol, please.

366
25:16.787 --> 25:18.163
One glass of milk, thank you.

367
25:20.457 --> 25:22.626
[Laura] So he took down 30 men?

368
25:22.709 --> 25:24.920
Prince Heinrey did? All by himself?

369
25:25.629 --> 25:26.797
[Artina] Plus one other.

370
25:26.880 --> 25:28.257
His attendant.

371
25:31.051 --> 25:32.052
[Verdi and Laura sigh]

372
25:32.678 --> 25:36.014
[giggles] He's even good at fighting, too!

373
25:36.515 --> 25:37.724
[bird chirps]

374
25:38.475 --> 25:40.561
-[gasps] -[taps on glass]

375
25:41.645 --> 25:44.690
[♪ enchanting music playing]

376
25:51.321 --> 25:52.447
[bird chirps]

377
25:52.531 --> 25:53.991
-Oh! -[all gasp]

378
25:54.074 --> 25:56.451
[Laura] Oh! Is that a bird? Where's it going?

379
25:56.535 --> 25:59.037
-[Verdi gasps] Oh! What's it doing here? -[exclaims]

380
26:00.789 --> 26:02.082
[Laura] Oh! Goodness me!

381
26:02.166 --> 26:03.792
-Oh my! -Oh!

382
26:11.341 --> 26:12.593
[bird chirps]

383
26:16.013 --> 26:17.556
What's this bird doing here?

384
26:17.639 --> 26:19.641
I know this bird. We've made friends.

385
26:21.018 --> 26:22.227
Right?

386
26:23.478 --> 26:24.855
[chirps]

387
26:24.938 --> 26:26.023
[Navier laughs]

388
26:27.441 --> 26:28.650
[chirps]

389
26:28.734 --> 26:30.652
What kind of bird is this?

390
26:30.736 --> 26:34.031
At the hunting grounds I swear I saw a similar bird.

391
26:34.740 --> 26:36.533
It has to be quite rare.

392
26:36.617 --> 26:38.368
[laughs] How fascinating.

393
26:38.452 --> 26:40.662
[Verdi] It looks like it's used to human hands.

394
26:40.746 --> 26:42.748
Its feathers are well cared for, too.

395
26:42.831 --> 26:44.499
[chuckles] He's friendly.

396
26:44.583 --> 26:45.626
Hi, little one.

397
26:45.709 --> 26:47.085
-[bird shrieks] -[Verdi exclaims]

398
26:47.169 --> 26:48.754
[Eliza] Oh!

399
26:48.837 --> 26:52.007
So, the bird just prefers Your Majesty, then.

400
26:52.090 --> 26:53.926
You came with another letter today.

401
26:55.260 --> 26:57.554
[gasps] Who has been sending letters?

402
26:58.680 --> 27:00.098
It's a mystery.

403
27:03.727 --> 27:04.728
[Verdi] We're so curious.

404
27:05.395 --> 27:07.439
Please, would you read it to us as well?

405
27:10.651 --> 27:12.653
[Navier] "I am a guest on my way to the Eastern Empire

406
27:12.736 --> 27:14.821
"to attend the New Year's Celebration.

407
27:14.905 --> 27:18.450
"I chanced upon a field of beautiful purple flowers on my journey

408
27:18.533 --> 27:20.244
"and decided to rest there for a day.

409
27:20.327 --> 27:24.998
"Now my 'fate' is safely making its way toward its objective,

410
27:25.082 --> 27:26.625
"so please be reassured.

411
27:28.085 --> 27:29.252
"Lastly,

412
27:29.836 --> 27:31.797
"do you know the name of this flower?"

413
27:33.048 --> 27:35.300
[gasps] Wisteria, I'm certain!

414
27:35.384 --> 27:38.470
There's a field of Wisteria near Mons Harbor!

415
27:38.553 --> 27:41.223
Your Majesty's family is from Mons Harbor, isn't it?

416
27:41.848 --> 27:43.266
[inhales]

417
27:49.314 --> 27:50.524
Hello.

418
27:50.607 --> 27:52.693
Did you come all the way to give me this?

419
27:52.776 --> 27:53.902
[chirps]

420
27:53.986 --> 27:55.612
You've come quite a distance.

421
27:55.696 --> 27:56.697
[chirps]

422
27:58.740 --> 28:00.409
[all chuckling]

423
28:01.118 --> 28:03.453
[Verdi] Look at it gulping down that water.

424
28:03.537 --> 28:05.288
-[Verdi laughs] -Its journey must have been difficult.

425
28:05.372 --> 28:08.291
[Laura] What country do you think this guest is from?

426
28:12.337 --> 28:13.922
-Is it that good? -Hmm.

427
28:14.423 --> 28:17.092
Everything in the palace tastes so wonderful.

428
28:17.175 --> 28:19.594
-[♪ gentle music playing] -The fruit,

429
28:19.678 --> 28:20.887
the chocolate,

430
28:20.971 --> 28:22.097
the vegetable soup,

431
28:22.180 --> 28:23.640
the meat and the cookies…

432
28:23.724 --> 28:26.727
Even the water's perfect. It's so delicious! It's so fresh!

433
28:26.810 --> 28:28.270
[laughing]

434
28:31.815 --> 28:34.026
What do you do with yourself while I am away?

435
28:34.109 --> 28:36.570
Hmm. Mostly, I think of you.

436
28:37.279 --> 28:38.321
Hmm…

437
28:39.031 --> 28:40.991
And the view is lovely.

438
28:42.576 --> 28:45.454
I've been enjoying watching people from the window.

439
28:47.956 --> 28:50.834
I wonder what they've said when I see them all laughing.

440
28:50.917 --> 28:52.919
Those elegant ladies…

441
28:53.003 --> 28:54.838
They make such pretty expressions.

442
28:56.131 --> 28:59.259
Do they all learn about expressions, too?

443
29:00.469 --> 29:01.470
Of course.

444
29:02.471 --> 29:03.722
You mean it?

445
29:04.931 --> 29:06.433
Rashta wants to learn as well.

446
29:07.434 --> 29:08.435
No chance.

447
29:08.518 --> 29:10.562
[cutely] Why no?

448
29:10.645 --> 29:12.355
You don't need to learn anything.

449
29:12.898 --> 29:14.649
You're already lovable

450
29:15.150 --> 29:16.234
just as you are.

451
29:18.487 --> 29:19.821
[Rashta chuckles]

452
29:20.530 --> 29:21.823
Is the Empress nice?

453
29:24.242 --> 29:25.368
Is she always smiling?

454
29:30.624 --> 29:32.459
[♪ music continues]

455
29:43.220 --> 29:44.221
[chirps]

456
29:46.098 --> 29:48.141
[Navier] "The letter brought by the bird

457
29:49.351 --> 29:51.269
"carried the fragrance of my childhood.

458
29:54.356 --> 29:57.275
"The flower is called wisteria.

459
29:58.318 --> 30:02.656
"It needs a certain soil and climate, so it cannot be grown in other regions.

460
30:05.408 --> 30:09.663
"To the accidental 'fate' that sent me such a beautiful memory…

461
30:12.332 --> 30:14.042
"my endless gratitude."

462
30:16.294 --> 30:18.588
If a noble young lady is like that,

463
30:19.548 --> 30:23.885
how elegant Her Highness' expressions must be.

464
30:24.803 --> 30:26.263
Is she always smiling?

465
30:27.013 --> 30:30.600
I imagine her being so beautiful and so refined.

466
30:32.185 --> 30:34.020
If you get a bit bored,

467
30:34.104 --> 30:36.648
why don't you go outside and play in the garden?

468
30:37.232 --> 30:38.525
Can I do that?

469
30:38.608 --> 30:39.734
Yes, of course.

470
30:39.818 --> 30:41.236
[Rashta chuckles softly]

471
30:41.319 --> 30:44.531
Lante said to me, "Make sure you don't roam around outside."

472
30:45.157 --> 30:46.366
Oh, did he?

473
30:46.449 --> 30:47.659
[Rashta] Mmm.

474
30:51.580 --> 30:53.331
[♪ gentle music playing]

475
30:53.415 --> 30:54.499
[Sovieshu moans]

476
31:09.514 --> 31:10.932
[inhales]

477
31:17.189 --> 31:18.190
[Navier] "P.S.

478
31:18.273 --> 31:22.444
"Come to think of it, the bird's eyes are the same purple as the flower petals.

479
31:24.529 --> 31:26.031
"What is the bird's name?"

480
31:29.075 --> 31:30.535
[door closes]

481
31:41.922 --> 31:45.884
Is the Emperor going to spend the night with that woman?

482
31:49.679 --> 31:51.181
And you let his staff know

483
31:51.973 --> 31:54.351
that it is my cycle's fertile window?

484
31:55.810 --> 31:56.853
Yes.

485
32:00.815 --> 32:02.234
Well, never mind.

486
32:02.317 --> 32:03.777
If you'd like to get changed,

487
32:04.402 --> 32:06.071
the maids-in-waiting can help you.

488
32:07.280 --> 32:08.531
A little later.

489
32:18.959 --> 32:20.919
[Eliza] Please, allow me, Your Majesty.

490
32:26.174 --> 32:29.886
My daughters still ask me to brush their hair

491
32:29.970 --> 32:31.763
when they pay a visit

492
32:31.846 --> 32:33.848
since my hands attend to Your Majesty.

493
32:34.474 --> 32:36.017
They may be older now,

494
32:36.101 --> 32:38.979
but they are still very precious and sacred hands.

495
32:42.190 --> 32:43.775
This is so soothing.

496
32:44.609 --> 32:46.403
[♪ moody music playing]

497
32:50.115 --> 32:51.157
Tell me…

498
32:52.784 --> 32:56.204
You've been with your husband a while. Are you still in love?

499
32:58.331 --> 32:59.332
Hmm…

500
33:00.917 --> 33:03.420
We do still love each other.

501
33:05.839 --> 33:07.465
I've never felt this before.

502
33:08.174 --> 33:10.010
I've found myself wondering…

503
33:13.096 --> 33:15.348
is the Emperor who I truly love?

504
33:15.932 --> 33:17.142
I had never felt…

505
33:18.601 --> 33:20.520
certain about his love for me,

506
33:22.105 --> 33:24.232
though he gave me no reason to question it.

507
33:25.650 --> 33:26.860
And yet…

508
33:29.112 --> 33:30.572
my heart's been aching.

509
33:41.708 --> 33:43.793
An unexplored passion can make fire…

510
33:44.377 --> 33:46.338
then it burns out all the more rapidly.

511
33:47.172 --> 33:51.301
Besides, she cannot even be accepted into the Imperial Palace.

512
33:51.384 --> 33:55.638
Your Majesty, think of it as though it is just a fleeting cloud.

513
34:05.148 --> 34:06.900
[exhales softly]

514
34:06.983 --> 34:09.527
[laughter]

515
34:09.611 --> 34:11.488
Isn't that just great, Mother?

516
34:11.571 --> 34:14.574
Oh, dear! They say she was all excited,

517
34:14.657 --> 34:16.659
spruced up and waiting for her husband,

518
34:16.743 --> 34:18.495
-who had gone to… -[both laughing]

519
34:18.578 --> 34:20.914
…crawl into another bed with a different girl!

520
34:20.997 --> 34:22.332
[both laughing]

521
34:22.415 --> 34:25.585
Oh, good heavens! That haughty bitch is about to share her husband,

522
34:25.668 --> 34:29.422
not even with a commoner, no, it's even better, she's just a slave girl!

523
34:29.506 --> 34:31.341
[both laughing]

524
34:31.424 --> 34:33.176
[sighs in satisfaction] So…

525
34:33.760 --> 34:35.553
what's the mood like in the palace?

526
34:35.637 --> 34:36.846
Inside, she's furious.

527
34:36.930 --> 34:38.890
And, Mother, there's not a thing she can do.

528
34:38.973 --> 34:41.518
With her sense of pride, would she grab the Emperor by the hair?

529
34:41.601 --> 34:43.895
-Or would she scratch his face? -[chuckles]

530
34:43.978 --> 34:45.730
[laughs] And that would be quite a sight to see!

531
34:46.314 --> 34:49.359
It looks like His Highness has been enchanted by her.

532
34:49.442 --> 34:50.860
Mmm-hmm.

533
34:51.361 --> 34:53.905
Our plan to get one of our girls in there,

534
34:53.988 --> 34:55.407
we should put that on hold.

535
34:56.366 --> 34:58.201
You believe he won't just enjoy her for a while,

536
34:58.284 --> 34:59.786
then dispose of her?

537
34:59.869 --> 35:02.997
I heard that the truth is he's desperate to formally make her his mistress

538
35:03.081 --> 35:04.833
so he's trying to change the law.

539
35:04.916 --> 35:05.917
My word!

540
35:06.000 --> 35:08.378
Her Highness said no person without an identity

541
35:08.461 --> 35:09.963
could be allowed to stay.

542
35:10.046 --> 35:12.632
And that's still the opinion of the High Justices.

543
35:12.716 --> 35:14.718
Totally opposed.

544
35:15.301 --> 35:18.221
Since she's a slave, she could be moved on without a family?

545
35:18.304 --> 35:19.723
Mmm-hmm.

546
35:19.806 --> 35:22.016
[♪ ominous music playing]

547
35:22.100 --> 35:24.102
But perhaps it might not need to change.

548
35:25.687 --> 35:26.688
Huh?

549
35:26.771 --> 35:30.942
All I'm saying is we should scratch an itch on His Highness' back.

550
35:31.025 --> 35:32.318
You scratch mine…

551
35:33.069 --> 35:35.530
Yes. I told her to avoid going out

552
35:35.613 --> 35:38.199
and coming into contact with people as much as possible, sire.

553
35:39.576 --> 35:40.577
Why's that?

554
35:40.660 --> 35:43.204
She's new and maybe hasn't learned our rules by now.

555
35:43.288 --> 35:47.208
If she made a mistake and became the subject of gossip, then…

556
35:48.084 --> 35:50.545
the palace could find itself in a tough position.

557
35:52.005 --> 35:57.594
There are no rules or any etiquette to teach a slave-born nobody, then?

558
35:58.762 --> 35:59.929
[gulping nervously]

559
36:00.013 --> 36:02.140
[♪ serious music playing]

560
36:05.101 --> 36:08.646
I should say, you still have some visitors and appointments, sire.

561
36:08.730 --> 36:09.856
Are you ready?

562
36:13.985 --> 36:16.946
Your Majesty, Lady Albani has requested an audience.

563
36:19.115 --> 36:20.533
What business has she here?

564
36:20.617 --> 36:22.577
Bothering His Majesty with her grievances again?

565
36:27.791 --> 36:28.792
Please enter.

566
36:28.875 --> 36:30.877
[♪ dramatic music playing]

567
36:45.058 --> 36:46.559
[inaudible]

568
36:49.687 --> 36:51.147
[♪ music intensifies]

569
36:55.443 --> 36:56.611
[Eliza] Yes, of course.

570
37:01.407 --> 37:02.826
A messenger came from the East Palace.

571
37:02.909 --> 37:06.830
His Highness hopes Rashta will get a registration as his mistress quite soon.

572
37:06.913 --> 37:08.039
[Laura gasps]

573
37:13.086 --> 37:15.088
[♪ tense music playing]

574
37:22.262 --> 37:23.680
What on earth has happened?

575
37:23.763 --> 37:27.016
We all thought she could never be registered as a mistress.

576
37:32.188 --> 37:35.149
REQUEST TO REGISTER RASHTA OF HOUSE BOTULIN AS IMPERIAL MISTRESS

577
37:37.777 --> 37:39.571
They've requested a review,

578
37:39.654 --> 37:41.114
now they've met the conditions.

579
37:43.241 --> 37:45.577
A family has decided to adopt Rashta, it says.

580
37:45.660 --> 37:47.412
MISS RASHTA OF THE BOTULIN FAMILY

581
37:47.495 --> 37:49.330
It's Lady Albani's family.

582
37:50.748 --> 37:53.042
This will mean that she will now be legitimate.

583
37:53.126 --> 37:54.544
-[Laura gasps] -Good heavens!

584
37:54.627 --> 37:56.796
They would do this to make that slave…

585
38:02.719 --> 38:03.761
Say that I'll sign it.

586
38:03.845 --> 38:05.305
Your Majesty!

587
38:05.388 --> 38:07.015
If she is in the Botulin family,

588
38:08.224 --> 38:10.184
there's no grounds for me to oppose it.

589
38:10.935 --> 38:12.061
But it's so…

590
38:13.021 --> 38:14.689
Let's not let this upset us.

591
38:15.773 --> 38:17.233
Focus on the party instead.

592
38:17.317 --> 38:18.526
We will be celebrating

593
38:18.610 --> 38:21.237
the Eastern Empire's 100 years of greatness.

594
38:22.405 --> 38:24.032
We don't want to make any mistakes.

595
38:24.616 --> 38:25.617
-Yes, Majesty. -Yes, Majesty.

596
38:30.955 --> 38:32.707
[Navier] Draft the contract clauses.

597
38:39.088 --> 38:41.007
I will discuss it with the Marquess.

598
38:41.090 --> 38:42.592
[♪ pensive music playing]

599
38:49.557 --> 38:50.600
This is absurd!

600
38:50.683 --> 38:51.935
What is His Majesty thinking?

601
38:52.018 --> 38:54.145
Does he really want to reconcile with his uncle's family

602
38:54.228 --> 38:55.396
to give that girl status?

603
38:55.480 --> 38:57.815
Lower your voice, His Majesty will hear you.

604
38:57.899 --> 39:00.109
Their intentions are perfectly clear.

605
39:00.193 --> 39:03.154
They will try to milk their association with Rashta for all it's worth.

606
39:03.237 --> 39:04.948
They've got their eye on the throne.

607
39:05.031 --> 39:06.407
They're a threat to the royal family.

608
39:06.491 --> 39:08.326
They prostrated themselves

609
39:08.409 --> 39:12.080
and swore they would never again challenge His Majesty the Emperor's authority.

610
39:12.163 --> 39:13.665
Do you even believe what you're saying?

611
39:13.748 --> 39:16.084
His Majesty's authority is so strong

612
39:16.167 --> 39:18.628
that nobody would ever dare to challenge him at all.

613
39:19.462 --> 39:20.713
And that's what I truly believe.

614
39:21.714 --> 39:22.840
Please, sit down.

615
39:28.429 --> 39:31.349
Albani is ruthless and you have given her free rein.

616
39:31.432 --> 39:35.353
It will be interesting to witness what kind of wickedness she will inflict…

617
39:35.895 --> 39:37.355
and it's your responsibility.

618
39:37.897 --> 39:41.067
THE EASTERN EMPIRE'S CODE OF LAW

619
39:43.736 --> 39:45.113
So shall we begin?

620
39:45.697 --> 39:46.698
Ah.

621
39:46.781 --> 39:47.824
[footsteps approaching]

622
39:51.786 --> 39:52.787
Go ahead.

623
39:54.038 --> 39:56.290
[♪ lively music playing]

624
39:56.374 --> 39:57.709
[Kisia laughing]

625
39:57.792 --> 39:59.669
[Cherini] Lady Rashta, you must slow down!

626
39:59.752 --> 40:01.212
You should walk slowly!

627
40:01.295 --> 40:03.131
[all laughing]

628
40:04.507 --> 40:06.217
[Rashta inhales, sighs deeply]

629
40:10.054 --> 40:11.139
Ah!

630
40:19.063 --> 40:20.815
[birds chirping]

631
40:30.533 --> 40:31.993
If only that bird would come.

632
40:32.076 --> 40:33.536
She needs something to lift her spirits.

633
40:34.746 --> 40:35.913
[Verdi] I know what you mean.

634
40:43.629 --> 40:45.214
Look here,

635
40:45.298 --> 40:48.760
isn't the weather so lovely today?

636
40:51.512 --> 40:52.764
Yes, it is.

637
40:52.847 --> 40:54.223
Let's do something fun.

638
40:54.307 --> 40:56.476
We could have a walk and a picnic on the lawn.

639
40:56.559 --> 40:58.811
-That sounds wonderful! -Let's go out. Please?

640
41:01.647 --> 41:04.692
[Kisia] Ah! I just love this sunshine, don't you?

641
41:04.776 --> 41:05.777
[all laughing]

642
41:06.402 --> 41:08.154
Oh, careful. Please take care!

643
41:08.237 --> 41:09.947
-[Cherini] Oh! Oh, careful, careful! -[Kisia] Don't tear it!

644
41:10.031 --> 41:11.240
Mind your dress. Please!

645
41:15.703 --> 41:18.247
[Laura] Wow! The weather's really beautiful today!

646
41:18.331 --> 41:20.458
-I'm so glad we came out, aren't you? -[Kisia] My goodness!

647
41:20.541 --> 41:21.834
But that's the Empress.

648
41:21.918 --> 41:23.961
[Laura] I asked the chef to pack one of your favorites!

649
41:24.045 --> 41:26.339
[Verdi] Will you let me have a clue, or are you just teasing me?

650
41:26.422 --> 41:27.715
-The Empress? -It is!

651
41:27.799 --> 41:29.550
[Laura] Ah, you'll have to wait and see!

652
41:31.344 --> 41:32.637
-Oh! -[Kisia] Oh! Lady Rashta!

653
41:35.139 --> 41:36.516
[♪ music fades]

654
41:44.023 --> 41:45.483
Rashta, Your Majesty.

655
41:46.275 --> 41:48.528
[♪ tense music playing]

656
41:54.742 --> 41:55.827
[maid] Rashta?

657
41:56.661 --> 41:58.121
She's that sla--

658
41:58.704 --> 41:59.956
How dare she talk to us?

659
42:00.540 --> 42:03.126
I was supposed to find His Majesty in the garden,

660
42:03.209 --> 42:04.752
now I think I've lost my way.

661
42:06.212 --> 42:08.339
We've not been introduced.

662
42:09.340 --> 42:10.341
[chuckles softly]

663
42:10.925 --> 42:15.012
I'm the one His Majesty has favored and now I stay here in this big palace.

664
42:16.139 --> 42:17.765
[exhales] I see.

665
42:18.391 --> 42:19.642
I know who you are now.

666
42:20.935 --> 42:22.103
Oh, you do?

667
42:22.770 --> 42:24.188
I'm so glad.

668
42:24.272 --> 42:28.526
Actually, I have been wondering when I should come and pay my respects.

669
42:28.609 --> 42:29.902
What's that?

670
42:29.986 --> 42:31.654
I did ask His Majesty,

671
42:31.737 --> 42:34.532
although he just kept telling me I shouldn't worry.

672
42:36.284 --> 42:37.285
What a blessing!

673
42:37.368 --> 42:40.413
Since we'll be seeing each other often, I can greet you now.

674
42:40.997 --> 42:42.999
After all, Your Majesty and I…

675
42:44.125 --> 42:46.127
we'll be joined together in this family.

676
42:48.754 --> 42:49.964
Like sisters.

677
42:55.845 --> 42:57.221
What did you just say?

678
42:57.305 --> 42:58.890
Like sisters.

679
42:58.973 --> 43:01.267
We're sharing a husband, so that connects us.

680
43:09.734 --> 43:13.321
So could I please call you older sister?

681
43:13.404 --> 43:15.615
[chuckles softly]

682
43:19.660 --> 43:20.661
You can't.

683
43:29.170 --> 43:31.756
You're saying you don't like Rashta?

684
43:31.839 --> 43:33.925
This is not a matter of me liking you.

685
43:34.884 --> 43:36.219
In truth,

686
43:36.302 --> 43:38.554
you became His Majesty's woman,

687
43:38.638 --> 43:40.473
not my sister, isn't that so?

688
43:42.516 --> 43:44.101
In any case, you're still…

689
43:50.316 --> 43:51.484
That'll do.

690
43:55.821 --> 43:57.240
No, I didn't. Wait, just a moment.

691
43:57.865 --> 43:59.200
Don't go!

692
43:59.867 --> 44:00.868
[Navier gasps]

693
44:00.952 --> 44:01.994
[Laura gasps] Your Majesty!

694
44:02.078 --> 44:03.829
-[Cherini] Lady Rashta! -[Laura] Goodness. Why, you!

695
44:03.913 --> 44:04.914
[Verdi] How insolent.

696
44:04.997 --> 44:06.123
[Laura] How dare you lay your hands on her?

697
44:06.207 --> 44:07.375
How filthy!

698
44:13.547 --> 44:15.424
[Sovieshu] You call a person filthy?

699
44:24.308 --> 44:25.309
[♪ music fades]

700
44:26.519 --> 44:27.728
What's the meaning of this?

701
44:27.812 --> 44:29.438
[Rashta sobbing]

702
44:29.522 --> 44:31.148
[♪ tense music playing]

703
44:42.785 --> 44:44.120
Now, now, don't cry.

704
44:46.956 --> 44:48.332
[Rashta continues sobbing]

705
44:49.250 --> 44:50.626
[exhales] Let's go.

706
44:51.919 --> 44:53.170
It's time we left.

707
44:54.088 --> 44:55.214
[Sovieshu] Wait there.

708
45:01.095 --> 45:02.305
Leave your lady behind.

709
45:02.388 --> 45:03.848
-[Laura gasps] -[♪ music intensifies]

710
45:07.435 --> 45:08.644
Why, what is the matter?

711
45:08.728 --> 45:09.895
Just leave her here.

712
45:09.979 --> 45:11.731
What for, Your Majesty?

713
45:11.814 --> 45:14.442
She's my lady-in-waiting, so you need to tell me why first.

714
45:14.525 --> 45:18.112
Perhaps she is your lady-in-waiting. She's my subject, however.

715
45:19.780 --> 45:23.242
She'll be reminded that people like her shouldn't talk so cruelly.

716
45:25.286 --> 45:28.289
She'll be locked up for three days with only hard bread and water.

717
45:29.081 --> 45:31.834
[sighs] Majesty, that is far too much.

718
45:32.835 --> 45:35.171
That girl tugged upon my dress.

719
45:35.254 --> 45:36.964
These ladies merely stopped her pulling.

720
45:37.048 --> 45:39.467
Empress, you call her "that girl" when she's here.

721
45:39.550 --> 45:42.178
And what of it if she pulled your dress a little?

722
45:42.928 --> 45:46.891
Do you think that your dress is worth more than a person's hand?

723
45:50.728 --> 45:52.146
In that case, sire,

724
45:52.229 --> 45:54.857
my maid could easily come and give your cloak's hem a tug.

725
45:54.940 --> 45:58.778
Perhaps retaliation would be a more just penalty.

726
45:58.861 --> 46:00.029
I trust that you agree?

727
46:00.112 --> 46:01.447
[Sovieshu scoffs]

728
46:02.948 --> 46:05.284
You're so stubborn that you don't give an inch.

729
46:06.452 --> 46:08.996
How would that be in any way equivalent to this?

730
46:09.080 --> 46:10.122
It's similar.

731
46:10.206 --> 46:11.749
-No, it's not. -Why not?

732
46:11.832 --> 46:13.667
Rashta is not a serving girl, is she?

733
46:14.919 --> 46:15.961
[exhales deeply]

734
46:16.754 --> 46:19.423
Lady Laura is a daughter of nobility.

735
46:19.507 --> 46:20.800
She can't go to prison for this!

736
46:21.967 --> 46:23.260
Five days.

737
46:24.345 --> 46:27.431
Your lady-in-waiting will serve five now.

738
46:40.736 --> 46:41.779
I'll go.

739
46:42.947 --> 46:45.282
I accept the punishment, Your Majesty.

740
46:51.288 --> 46:53.541
[♪ music continues]

741
47:06.178 --> 47:07.430
You may go.

742
47:16.730 --> 47:19.233
[♪ music crescendos]

743
47:19.775 --> 47:21.735
[breathing heavily]

744
47:22.945 --> 47:25.614
[Kisia] His Majesty was so incredibly wonderful.

745
47:25.698 --> 47:27.575
I thought my heart would burst back there.

746
47:27.658 --> 47:28.784
[Cherini] Oh, yes, me too!

747
47:28.868 --> 47:32.121
His Majesty must truly love Lady Rashta very much.

748
47:32.204 --> 47:34.707
-[both giggling] -That is enough now, you two.

749
47:34.790 --> 47:35.916
I'm blushing.

750
47:36.000 --> 47:38.711
[Cherini] Well, honestly, how could any man not be in love

751
47:38.794 --> 47:42.131
with someone who's as kind and as beautiful and as pure as you?

752
47:42.214 --> 47:45.926
His Highness and you remind us of two lovers in a fairytale.

753
47:46.010 --> 47:47.094
[Cherini] Mmm.

754
47:47.178 --> 47:48.179
That's right.

755
47:48.262 --> 47:50.764
Rashta is just extremely happy!

756
47:51.348 --> 47:52.850
Every day, I ask if it's all really true.

757
47:52.933 --> 47:54.602
It's real. It's all true.

758
47:54.685 --> 47:55.936
This is a miracle!

759
47:56.020 --> 47:58.772
And it could only happen because you're the great Lady Rashta!

760
47:58.856 --> 48:01.150
Did you not see it while we were in the garden before?

761
48:01.233 --> 48:03.277
-[Kisia] Uh-huh. -The admiring looks in people's eyes

762
48:03.360 --> 48:06.655
as they turned around to look, struck by Lady Rashta's beauty.

763
48:06.739 --> 48:07.948
[both squeal excitedly]

764
48:09.742 --> 48:11.243
-[Kisia] Ah, really. -[Cherini] Yes, I mean it!

765
48:11.327 --> 48:12.786
Everyone was turning round to look.

766
48:12.870 --> 48:15.289
[Kisia] They couldn't stop staring at you.

767
48:15.372 --> 48:18.042
And girls, earlier on, did you spot this?

768
48:18.125 --> 48:21.712
Her Majesty was shaking terribly with anger.

769
48:21.795 --> 48:23.297
[all giggling]

770
48:23.380 --> 48:24.673
[Kisia] Yes, I did.

771
48:24.757 --> 48:25.883
Although…

772
48:26.383 --> 48:28.969
this is just for your ears, so keep this quiet,

773
48:29.053 --> 48:33.057
Her Majesty wasn't as impressive as she thinks she is.

774
48:33.140 --> 48:34.183
Ooh!

775
48:34.975 --> 48:36.060
Mmm.

776
48:36.977 --> 48:38.395
That's bad for her.

777
48:40.606 --> 48:41.815
[chuckles softly]

778
48:42.608 --> 48:44.068
[sighs contentedly]

779
48:46.153 --> 48:47.947
[chuckles softly]

780
48:52.576 --> 48:53.827
[water running]

781
48:55.287 --> 48:56.330
[sighs]

782
48:56.914 --> 48:58.332
[sobbing]

783
49:01.835 --> 49:03.420
[bird screeches]

784
49:03.504 --> 49:04.922
[♪ uplifting music playing]

785
49:13.347 --> 49:14.515
[bird chirps]

786
49:15.099 --> 49:17.017
You always find a way to track me down.

787
49:28.612 --> 49:32.241
"The bird's name. Is such a thing necessary?

788
49:33.951 --> 49:37.329
"If you think it is, I would like you to decide."

789
49:43.210 --> 49:44.545
Why am I crying, you wonder?

790
49:45.879 --> 49:47.673
-[chirps] -[sighs]

791
49:48.299 --> 49:50.551
Could it be you understood that?

792
49:51.594 --> 49:53.762
[chirping]

793
49:53.846 --> 49:55.556
[chuckles softly]

794
49:56.098 --> 49:57.224
You're so sweet.

795
49:57.308 --> 49:58.642
[chirps]

796
49:59.685 --> 50:01.103
This is like

797
50:02.062 --> 50:03.981
my own private little hideaway.

798
50:05.482 --> 50:07.443
I cannot cry anywhere else,

799
50:08.902 --> 50:11.989
but when I'm here, I can embrace my sorrow alone.

800
50:18.287 --> 50:20.289
You know, this place is my personal secret.

801
50:20.914 --> 50:24.084
So you are the only one who is privy to my tears.

802
50:27.338 --> 50:28.964
[♪ gentle music playing]

803
50:51.028 --> 50:52.237
[chuckles softly]

804
50:57.785 --> 50:59.119
You are very kind.

805
51:00.454 --> 51:01.580
[chirps]

806
51:04.291 --> 51:05.709
Now your name.

807
51:06.835 --> 51:08.295
What would suit you?

808
51:09.797 --> 51:11.465
[♪ uplifting music playing]

809
51:14.009 --> 51:15.260
The bird's name…

810
51:20.808 --> 51:22.726
shall be Queen.

811
51:28.107 --> 51:29.650
Your name is decided.

812
51:31.360 --> 51:32.903
-[chirps] -As long as…

813
51:33.862 --> 51:35.364
it's agreeable to your master.

814
51:39.868 --> 51:40.911
[chirps]

815
51:44.498 --> 51:45.541
That's right.

816
51:47.084 --> 51:48.377
I am the Empress.

817
51:50.212 --> 51:52.047
My role that I shall fulfill

818
51:54.007 --> 51:56.260
is devotion to my people and their welfare.

819
51:56.844 --> 51:58.303
And I know that my purpose

820
51:59.471 --> 52:01.932
was never to conquer the heart of the Emperor.

821
52:12.735 --> 52:15.446
[♪ music intensifies]

822
52:41.263 --> 52:43.015
I will not be shaken.

823
52:44.558 --> 52:46.643
Nor will I be swept away.

824
52:46.727 --> 52:48.270
[♪ music continues]

825
52:48.353 --> 52:49.354
[bird screeches]

826
52:53.025 --> 52:54.610
[bird screeches]

827
53:19.802 --> 53:24.932
THE BIRD'S NAME SHALL BE QUEEN

828
53:27.976 --> 53:30.229
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

829
53:30.312 --> 53:32.314
[♪ closing theme music playing]
